			"notes": "Keep But Penalty 1.1.0 adds an optional consecutive-final-death schedule for respawn debuff durations.\n\n- `respawnDebuffDurationsSecondsByDeath` maps final-death count to a shared duration; zero skips the configured effects, and deaths beyond the list reuse its last value.\n- `respawnDebuffStreakResetSeconds` controls when surviving without another final death resets the schedule.\n- The streak persists across reconnects and respawn cloning.\n- Cancelled death events do not count, so compatible downed/rescue mechanics remain outside the streak.\n- An empty duration schedule preserves the existing fixed `effect_id,duration_seconds,level` behavior.\n\nMaintained NeoForge anchors: 1.21.1, 26.1.2, and 26.2. RinLib 0.3.1 matching the target remains required."
		},
