			"notes": "# Keep But Penalty 1.0.1\n\nThe maintained matrix now follows modpack anchor versions only:\n\n- NeoForge 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 26.1.2\n- NeoForge 26.2\n\nAll three artifacts use the same Keep But Penalty business source and require the exact matching RinLib 0.3.1 artifact. Non-anchor 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.8, and 1.21.11 files have been withdrawn.\n\nBehavior remains unchanged: no default penalties, configurable `respawnDebuffs`, and death-scoped inventory retention without persistent gamerule mutation."
